<section class="wrap thoughts">
  <h1 class="sec-title big"><span>思维阁</span><em>THOUGHT CABINET</em></h1>
  <p class="th-lead">有些想法在颅内结晶。给文章加上 <code>thought</code> 标签，它就会在这里定居。</p>
  <%
  const tq = site.tags.findOne({slug: 'thought'});
  if (tq && tq.posts && tq.posts.length) {
    tq.posts.sort('date', -1).forEach(function(post){ %>
    <div class="thought-card reveal">
      <div class="tc-head">
        <span class="tc-badge">⟡ 结晶中</span>
        <h2><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="tc-ex"><%= (strip_html(post.excerpt) || strip_html(post.content) || '').trim().replace(/\s+/g, ' ').slice(0, 140) %>…</p>
      <span class="tc-date">已内化于 <%= date(post.date, config.date_format) %> · 研究完成度 100%</span>
    </div>
  <% }); } else { %>
  <div class="thought-card empty">
    <p>思维阁空空如也。第一颗想法还未结晶。</p>
  </div>
  <% } %>
</section>
